hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2199","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Suno aur itaat karo! Agarchey tum par Habshi ghulaam muqarrar kya jaey jiska sar kishmish jaisa ho. (Bukhari: 7142)"
"2200","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum hukumat ki hirs karogey. Aur wo Qiyaamat key din nadaamat hogi. To doodh pilaanay wali achhi hai aur doodh chhudaanay wali buri hai. (Bukhari: 7148)"
"2201","[AI-translation] Yasaar key betey Maqil (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Banda nahi hai jise Allah raayaat ka nighebaan banaaye aur wo uski nasihat key sath hifaazat na karey magar wo Jannat ki khushbu na paaeyga. (Bukhari: 7150)"
"2202","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Maqil Raziallahu anhu se) bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Wali nahi hai jo Musalmaanon ki raayaat ka wali ho aur wo marta hai jabke wo un se dhoka karney wala hai magar Allah us par Jannat haraam karega. (Bukhari: 7151)"
"2203","[AI-translation] Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo sunaayega Allah uskey sath Qiyaamat key din sunaayega. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur jo tang karega Allah us par Qiyaamat key din tang karega. To unhon-ne kaha: Hamein wasiyat kijiye! To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak insaan mein pehla jo badbudaar hota hai uska pet hai. Phir jo taaqat rakkhey ke wo umda key siwa na khaey to use karna chaahiye. Aur jo taaqat rakkhey ke uskey aur Jannat key darmiyaan uski hatheli bhar khoon jo us ne bahaaya haael na ho to use karna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 7152)"
"2204","[AI-translation] Bakra key betey Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Haakim do key darmiyaan faisla na karey jabke wo ghussay mein ho. (Bukhari: 7158)"
"2205","[AI-translation] Huwaiyisa aur Muhaiyisa ki hadees Jihaad mein guzar chuki hai. Aur yahaan badhaa diya: Ya wo tumhaarey saathi ki diyat dein. Ya wo ladai ka elaan karein. (Bukhari: 7192)"
"2206","[AI-translation] Saamit key betey Ubaada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sun-ney aur itaat par baiat ki. Wo guzar chuki hai aur is riwayat mein badhaa diya: Aur ke ham khadey hon. Ya kahen haq key sath jahaan ham hon. Ham Allah mein malaamat karney waley ki malaamat se nahi dartey. (Bukhari: 7199 - 7200)"
"2207","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sun-ney aur itaat par baiat kartey to Aap ham se farmaatey: Jitna taaqat rakkho! (Bukhari: 7202)"
"2208","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar se kaha gaya: Kya tum khaleefa na muqarrar karogey? Unhon-ne kaha: Agar main khaleefa muqarrar karun to us ne khaleefa muqarrar kya jo mujh se behtar tha, Abu Bakr. Aur agar chhorun to us ne chhora jo mujh se behtar tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). (Bukhari: 7218)"
"2209","[AI-translation] Samura key betey Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Baarah ameer hongey. To Aap ne kalimat farmaya jo main ne nahi suna. To merey waalid ne kaha: Beshak Aap ne farmaya: Wo sab Quraish mein se hain. (Bukhari: 7222 - 7223). Abu Hurairah se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey chhoro jab tak main tumhey chhorun. Beshak tum se pehlay wo halaak huey apne sawal aur apne Nabiyon par ikhtelaaf key sabab. Phir jab main tumhey cheez se mana karun to us se bacho. Aur jab main tumhey hukm ka hukm dun to us mein se karo jitna taaqat rakkho. (7228). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Tamanna ki kitaab."
